# GitHub repo scope

This workspace may only interact with **https://github.com/Ironkd/StockStay**.

- Prefer explicit repo args (`gh … -R Ironkd/StockStay`, or `gh repo view Ironkd/StockStay`). The repo-local `gh repo set-default` is already set to this repo.
- Git remotes must stay pointed at `https://github.com/Ironkd/StockStay.git` (or the SSH equivalent). Do not add remotes for other repos.
- Never clone, push, open PRs, create issues, or change settings on any other GitHub repository from this workspace.
- If a task seems to require another repo, stop and ask the user instead of proceeding.
